Subject: [PATCH] x86/tools: include compiler definitions before decoder headers

The decoder headers can pull in kernel UAPI headers via the system
asm/byteorder.h. Include the tools definition of __attribute_const__
before that happens, as insn_decoder_test already does indirectly.

diff --git a/arch/x86/tools/insn_sanity.c b/arch/x86/tools/insn_sanity.c
--- a/arch/x86/tools/insn_sanity.c
+++ b/arch/x86/tools/insn_sanity.c
@@ -14,6 +14,7 @@
 #include <sys/types.h>
 #include <sys/stat.h>
 #include <fcntl.h>
+#include <linux/compiler.h>
 #include <asm/insn.h>
 #include <inat.c>
 #include <insn.c>
